CLEC reader background sounds
=============================

All recordings below were taken from official Freesound sound pages. The
license on each page was verified as CC0 1.0 (Public Domain Dedication) on
2026-11-13: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/

Hosted files are short mono 48 kbps MP3 transcodes (trimmed, with short fade
in/out) of the official Freesound HQ previews, made only to keep the reader
small. Audio is fetched only when the reader clicks that sound. Nothing is
downloaded on first open. There is no autoplay.

No Epidemic Sound (epidemicsound.com) or other commercial-library audio is
included, even if a copy was provided privately.

